                                "sense_id": "ec0490d8-44f3-39d7-82f2-fbbee353d09a",
                                "text": "Here now they cry out, that the Commaunders of our Fleete haue delt iniuriously with them, they exclaime that the leagues are broken, that their old priuiledges in England are violated, which they chalenge to belong to their Cities, and ought to be kept and mainteined."
                            },
