                                "example_id": "63954a16-162f-4a8e-9363-9939756ababe",
                                "sense_id": "ec0490d8-44f3-39d7-82f2-fbbee353d09a",
                                "text": "PHILOMATHES. Indeede there is cause inough, but rather to leaue him at all, then to runne more plainlie to him, if they were wise he delt with."
                            }
                        ]
